The hook command that runs unchanged in both bash and PowerShell (plugin/hooks/hooks.json,
generated by scripts/gen_hooks.py) follows the approach of maisecrets
(https://github.com/Mcpgate-de/maisecrets), Copyright 2026 Andreas Kruse (Sprinterli),
Apache License 2.0.

Cloakroom downloads and runs the PII-Tracer model (https://huggingface.co/perplexity-ai/PII-Tracer)
at a pinned revision; the model is not redistributed here and keeps its own license (MIT).

The benchmark adapters in bench/adapters/ call other open-source tools that are fetched
separately by bench/setup_competitors.sh; their code is not included in this repository.
